om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Interleave already-computed neg-exp scales with dt bias.
note len sc is twice len ng, and len dt equals len ng. The exp stays in C.
fn av_gdnsc ng view f32 * dt view f32 * sc edit f32 * to ulong
if ne len ng len dt
ret 1
end
if ne len sc add len ng len ng
ret 1
end
n = len ng
for i ulong n
put sc mul i 2 get ng i
put sc add mul i 2 1 get dt i
end
ret 0
end
